Cuaderno_2013_1_E	27	question	-	The nurse identifies that the person she has evaluated presents a series of manifestations that correspond to the defining characteristics of a diagnostic label, however, does not identify any possible cause. How should you enunciate the diagnosis following the guidelines of the PES format?
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	27	answer	0	Problem related to unknown cause manifested by the defining characteristics identified.
