Cuaderno_2013_1_E	27	answer	3	Problem related to the defining characteristics identified.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	27	answer	4	The absence of cause means that there is no problem, so a diagnosis could not be stated.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	28	question	-	When recording the data obtained during the execution of the care, the appropriate thing is:
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	28	answer	0	Take some time to make the annotations, after a reflection based on what is remembered.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	28	answer	1	Focus on the important problems and events that communicate what is different that day in that person.
