Cuaderno_2013_1_E	76	answer	3	Increase the volume.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	76	answer	4	Decrease the risk of infection.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	77	question	-	Indicate which of the following safety precautions used in the care of the patient receiving brachytherapy is NOT true:
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	77	answer	0	Single room.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	77	answer	1	Prohibition of visits of children.
