Cuaderno_2013_1_E	78	answer	3	Benzene.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	78	answer	4	Nickel.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	79	question	-	The gradation of a tumor refers to:
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	79	answer	0	Determine the extent of the disease by considering tumor size and spread.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	79	answer	1	Measure the abnormal cell growth with respect to the size, shape and disposition of the tumor.
