Cuaderno_2013_1_E	81	question	-	A 55-year-old woman with adrenal insufficiency has been prescribed corticosteroid treatment. Which of the following instructions would you provide in relation to this treatment?
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	81	answer	0	Take the drug first thing in the morning.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	81	answer	1	Take the drug before bedtime.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	81	answer	2	Exclude foods rich in calcium and vitamin D from the diet.
