Cuaderno_2013_1_E	82	answer	4	Cushing's syndrome.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	83	question	-	Mr. P. L., 59, has type 2 diabetes and his Body Mass Index is 27. He asks you if you can have a glass of wine with meals. Your answer is:
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	83	answer	0	You should refrain from drinking alcoholic beverages because of the risk of developing ketoacidosis.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	83	answer	1	You can do it, but you must incorporate the calories of alcohol into the meal plan.
