Cuaderno_2013_1_E	86	answer	4	Water and toxic substances are eliminated by ultrafiltration.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	87	question	-	P. L. is a patient with frequent urinary infections. When explaining the possible causes of the same will comment that a risk factor is:
