Cuaderno_2013_1_E	97	question	-	To measure the pulmonary wedge pressure (PEP) by means of a pulmonary artery catheter, it is advisable to take into account that:
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	97	answer	0	It is not necessary to inflate the ball.
