Cuaderno_2013_1_E	98	question	-	Central Venous Pressure (PVC) monitoring is a procedure performed frequently by nurses in the Critical Care Unit. Indicate the correct option regarding the performance of this hemodynamic measurement:
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	98	answer	0	It is only possible to perform it using electronic pressure transducers, expressing the measurement in cmH2O.
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	98	answer	1	It is only possible to carry it out by using electronic pressure transducers, expressing the measurement in mmHg.
