Cuaderno_2013_1_E	101	question	-	P. C. is a terminally ill patient with oral mucositis and pain, although he retains the ability to eat a solid diet. Which of the following actions would be indicated?
Cuaderno_2013_1_E	101	answer	0	Encourage him to suck pineapple chips.
