Cuaderno_2013_1_M	32	answer	2	The ratio of medians in time to progression of the two treatment groups is 0.54.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	32	answer	3	The log-rank test evaluates the average difference in the follow-up time.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	32	answer	4	The results of the log-rank test and the Hazard Ratio estimate (95% confidence interval, 95% CI), are not compatible since the first one indicates that the differences are significant while the second indicates that they are not.
