Cuaderno_2013_1_M	53	answer	4	Therapeutic management of immune thrombocyanic purpura (ITP).
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	54	question	-	Among the biological advantages of fever is NOT found.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	54	answer	0	Inhibits bacterial growth.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	54	answer	1	Increases bactericidal activity of phagocytes.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	54	answer	2	Stimulates the alternative route of the complement.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	54	answer	3	It stimulates the synthesis of acute phase proteins and immunoglobulins.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	54	answer	4	It produces serum iron sequestration.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	55	question	-	Which of the following cytokines exert an anti-inflammatory and immunosuppressive effect?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	55	answer	0	Interleukin-1 alpha, interleukin-1 beta.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	55	answer	1	Tumor necrosis factor-alpha, Tumor necrosis factor-beta.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	55	answer	2	Interleukin-17, Interleukin-22.
