Cuaderno_2013_1_M	56	question	-	The reactivation of a latent cytomegalovirus in an immunosuppressed patient can lead to a severe systemic picture. How would the ethological diagnosis?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	56	answer	0	Detecting the specific IgG in the serum.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	56	answer	1	By urine culture in an advanced cell line.
