Cuaderno_2013_1_M	58	answer	2	The hepatitis A virus
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	58	answer	3	The hepatitis E virus
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	58	answer	4	The TTV virus.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	59	question	-	Which of the following pathogens is the cause of cat scratch disease?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	59	answer	0	Bartonella henselae.
