Cuaderno_2013_1_M	59	answer	3	Toxoplasma gondii.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	59	answer	4	Epstein Barr virus.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	60	question	-	Mycobacterium tuberculosis complex includes the bacillus that causes human tuberculosis (Mycobacterium tuberculosis hominis, Koch's bacillus), as well as other mycobacteria, among which are the following, except one:
