Cuaderno_2013_1_M	84	answer	4	Adenocarcinoma of the esophagus.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	85	question	-	In the pathophysiology of peptic ulcer. What is the FALSE?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	85	answer	0	Much of the gastro-duodenal ulcers can be attributed to H. pylori infection or mucosal injury by NSAIDs.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	85	answer	1	H. pylori is not related to the development of gastric lymphoma.
