Cuaderno_2013_1_M	131	question	-	Regarding COPD, which one is FALSE?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	131	answer	0	Smoking is the most important factor in the development of COPD.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	131	answer	1	Contrary to asthma, there is no inflammatory component.
