Cuaderno_2013_1_M	142	question	-	Motor symptoms in Parkinson's disease predominate and define this entity. However, symptoms in other spheres are sometimes very relevant and are referred to by the general name of "Non-motor manifestations of Parkinson's disease". Which of the following is considered a non-motor symptom of Parkinson's disease?
