Cuaderno_2013_1_M	142	answer	4	Motor polyneuropathy.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	143	question	-	After a traffic accident, a 38-year-old patient enters the ICU in a coma. After several days the patient does not improve neurologically and CT shows hemorrhagic punctate lesions in the corpus callosum and cortico-subcortical union. What is your diagnosis?
