Cuaderno_2013_1_M	170	question	-	0 months previously healthy with acute gastroenteritis of one day of evolution and signs of mild dehydration, without blood or mucus in the stool and without oral intolerance. What is the initial choice treatment in our environment?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	170	answer	0	Intravenous rehydration, absolute diet 8 hours and start feeding with astringent diet.
