Cuaderno_2013_1_M	175	answer	3	Intramuscular methylprednisone.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	175	answer	4	Nebulized salbutamol.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	176	question	-	Woman of 40 weeks of gestation in labor with 6 cm of dilation. Presents fetal decelerative pattern in cardiotocographic record so it is decided to perform a fetal blood microtome to assess fetal well-being. Result pH 7.22. The correct behavior is:
