Cuaderno_2013_1_M	177	answer	4	I would recommend resorting to assisted reproduction techniques.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	178	question	-	Point out the INCORRECT response regarding infection by human immunodeficiency virus (HIV) and pregnancy:
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	178	answer	0	The scheduled cesarean does not reduce the vertical transmission rate of the virus.
