Cuaderno_2013_1_M	188	question	-	Point out the correct definition:
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	188	answer	0	The Necessary Number to Treat (NNT) is the inverse of the Relative Risk (RR).
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	188	answer	1	The Relative Risk Reduction (RRR) can clearly differentiate the big risks and benefits of the small ones.
