Cuaderno_2013_1_M	209	answer	3	Balanitis by Trichomonas.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	209	answer	4	Fungal infection by dermatophytes.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	210	question	-	What is the most important prognostic factor in Stage 1 Melanoma?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	210	answer	0	Serum LDH level.
