Cuaderno_2013_1_M	212	answer	3	Dissociative disorder
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	212	answer	4	Depersonalization disorder.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	213	question	-	50-year-old woman who for 1 month has a depressed mood, anhedonia, memory loss, easy crying, loss of energy, sense of worthlessness and guilt, marked weight loss and early awakening, as well as inability to perform their tasks usual at home. In separation proceedings for 3 months. Point out the most appropriate diagnosis:
