Cuaderno_2013_1_M	216	answer	3	Absence of other psychiatric disorders and legal processes.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	216	answer	4	Presence of convulsions and tremors.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	217	question	-	Which of these statements is FALSE regarding stupor?
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	217	answer	0	It is an alteration of consciousness.
Cuaderno_2013_1_M	217	answer	1	It can occur in melancholy.
