Cuaderno_2013_1_Q	63	answer	2	A large particle with a small charge will have great mobility.
Cuaderno_2013_1_Q	63	answer	3	A small particle of great load will have great mobility.
Cuaderno_2013_1_Q	63	answer	4	A charged micelle will have less mobility than another micelle of the same size but neutral.
Cuaderno_2013_1_Q	64	question	-	In the quantitative analysis by gas chromatography, to minimize the uncertainties that are introduced with the injection of the sample, the flow velocity and the variations in the conditions of the columns is used:
