Cuaderno_2014_1_E	168	answer	2	The perception of depth is distorted.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	168	answer	3	The threshold for the perception of light decreases.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	168	answer	4	There is a uniform loss of perception of all colors.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	169	question	-	During the aging process there are changes in the different systems and devices, being true that in the cardiovascular system:
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	169	answer	0	Increased sensitivity of the baroreceptors intensifies postural hypotension.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	169	answer	1	The three layers of the blood vessels are affected equally in the aging process.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	169	answer	2	The left ventricle decreases in size.
