Cuaderno_2014_1_E	175	question	-	Mrs. H. H. 69 years old complains that she does not sleep well. Regarding sleep in the elderly, it has been proven that:
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	175	answer	0	The non-pharmacological approach to insomnia has proved ineffective in this population.
