Cuaderno_2014_1_E	188	answer	2	The role of hospital management that specifically deals with supervising the remuneration and other working conditions of health professionals.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	188	answer	3	The care coordination of primary and specialized care centers within a health area.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	188	answer	4	The management of the care activity of a Service or Unit, without taking into account the management of resources, or administrative procedures, or any other consideration that is not the healthcare activity itself.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	189	question	-	The process management is:
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	189	answer	0	A management method, aimed at sequencing the supply processes of materials to the clinical units, to reduce replacement times and storage space.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	189	answer	1	The processing of information, through electronic media, to streamline decision making between services or units that are not close to each other, valid both for the Health Center and for hospitals.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	189	answer	2	A way of managing, in which administrative procedures are prioritized, in order to place those related to the client (or user) in the foreground and the procedures related to economic-financial management are relegated to the lower level.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	189	answer	3	A work system focused on achieving the continuous improvement of the functioning of an organization through the identification, selection, description, documentation and improvement of processes.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	189	answer	4	A variant of zero-based budget planning, in which, during the planning process, it is a question of adapting the means to the objectives in each one of the Departments, Services or Units of the Institution.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	190	question	-	What are the "Clinical Practice Guidelines" ?:
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	190	answer	0	Manuals prepared for the "practicum" of postgraduate students, where standards are given and some necessary considerations are detailed for that stage of their training.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	190	answer	1	A collection of paper and digital publications in which prestigious health professionals tell experiences and expose proposals of notable interest.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	190	answer	2	Reports selected by the Care Directions of some reference hospitals, in which health professionals explain cases and significant clinical events.
Cuaderno_2014_1_E	190	answer	3	A type of computer applications that allow healthcare professionals to obtain answers online, to questions they wish to ask about events that have occurred in their daily clinical practice.
