Cuaderno_2014_1_P	63	answer	2	Protect the rights of research animals.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	63	answer	3	Protect the rights of research subjects.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	63	answer	4	Regulate applied psychology
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	64	question	-	We can say that a psychological evaluator uses indirectly or inferentially self-reports of a person when:
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	64	answer	0	From them, something different from the expressed is extracted, interpreting it as an indicator of a psychological construction.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	64	answer	1	He takes it from the results provided by another psychotherapist.
