Cuaderno_2014_1_P	64	answer	4	The self-report has a behavioral character.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	65	question	-	The computerized psychological evaluation or "computer-assisted evaluation":
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	65	answer	0	It is limited to qualitative evaluation.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	65	answer	1	It replaces the evaluating psychologist in its entirety.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	65	answer	2	Analyze the results obtained, but does not serve as control or guidance.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	65	answer	3	It only responds to some evaluation objectives such as the cognitive field.
