Cuaderno_2014_1_P	125	answer	4	Addictive behavior
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	126	question	-	According to the results studies, when the Exposure technique is being applied, it must be taken into account that massive and prolonged exposure produces:
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	126	answer	0	Worst immediate results than spaced exposure.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	126	answer	1	Better immediate results than exposure spaced.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	126	answer	2	There are no differences in results regarding the type of exposure.
