Cuaderno_2014_1_P	129	answer	4	A cognitive product.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	130	question	-	Which of the following processes would be responsible for the results that are achieved through mindfulness meditation ?:
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	130	answer	0	Change the contents of the mind.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	130	answer	1	Change the relationship with the contents of the mind.
