Cuaderno_2014_1_P	131	answer	2	Eliminate or reduce behaviors.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	131	answer	3	Generate psychological stress due to incompatibility between behaviors.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	131	answer	4	Extinguish irrational beliefs.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	132	question	-	Among the techniques most used in Beck's Cognitive Therapy to identify or detect cognitive schemes is:
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	132	answer	0	The technique of the descending arrow.
