Cuaderno_2014_1_P	146	answer	3	There is a relative lack of response to other people's attempts to awaken it.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	146	answer	4	The subject has a quick access to the orientation and alert.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	147	question	-	Indicate which of the following statements is correct regarding depression:
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	147	answer	0	In childhood, there is a lower prevalence of dysthymia than of major depression.
