Cuaderno_2014_1_P	158	answer	3	Through behavioral testing in simulated situations.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	158	answer	4	Through questionnaires and inventories of personality traits.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	159	question	-	The focus therapy for auditory hallucinations of Betall, Haddock and Slade (1994) uses different therapeutic strategies. Which of the following options is NOT considered in the targeting therapy model ?:
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	159	answer	0	The patient is asked to fix and describe the physical characteristics of their voices (for example, tone, intensity, location).
