Cuaderno_2014_1_P	163	answer	3	The iconic therapy.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	163	answer	4	Cognitive therapy
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	164	question	-	Benjamin's Reconstructive Interpersonal Therapy includes as one of the most relevant aspects in the treatment of personality disorders:
