Cuaderno_2014_1_P	175	answer	4	The interpersonal deficits.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	176	question	-	The Problem Solving Therapy for depression includes within its proposals:
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	176	answer	0	Train relaxation responses in the patient as a means to improve reflection and the search for solutions.
Cuaderno_2014_1_P	176	answer	1	Encourage the patient to take positive actions, whatever they may be, even if they are not aimed at solving any specific problem.
