Cuaderno_2014_1_Q	30	question	-	Van Deemter's velocity equation tries to justify the contributions of the different effects that cause the widening of the chromatographic band, which are basically of four types:
Cuaderno_2014_1_Q	30	answer	0	Eddy diffusion, dead volume and resistance to convection in both phases, mobile and stationary.
