Cuaderno_2015_1_E	79	question	-	Luis has started his university studies this year. In a week you will have your first exam. He does not want to study for the exam, so he decides that this afternoon he will go to the cinema to have a relaxing day before it. This way of thinking justifies going to the movies instead of studying. Choose the defense mechanism Luis uses to justify his behavior:
