Cuaderno_2015_1_E	172	answer	2	Bodily injury
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	172	answer	3	Lack of privacy
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	173	question	-	The bacteria that in most cases are responsible for otitis media are:
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	173	answer	0	Streptococcus pneumoniae, Haemophilus influenzae and Klebsiella pneumoniae.
