Cuaderno_2015_1_E	173	answer	2	Haemophilus influenzae, Klebsiella pneumoniae and Moraxella catarrhalis.
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	173	answer	3	Streptococcus pneumoniae, Haemophilus influenzae and Moraxella catarrhalis.
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	174	question	-	What is NOT a clinical manifestation of a dying child ?:
