Cuaderno_2015_1_E	177	answer	0	Protest, despair and denial.
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	177	answer	1	Protest, denial and despair.
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	177	answer	2	Denial, protest and despair.
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	177	answer	3	Despair, protest and denial.
Cuaderno_2015_1_E	178	question	-	Which of the following viral infections is associated with the development of fulminating purpura in the neonate ?:
