Cuaderno_2015_1_M	17	answer	2	It is a diabetic glomerulosclerosis.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	17	answer	3	It is a membranous glomerulonephritis.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	18	question	-	Question linked to image nº19 Patient who reports recurrent lumbar pain, with irradiation to the inguinal area and left hip. The findings on the radiograph shown suggest a diagnosis of:
