Cuaderno_2015_1_M	24	question	-	Question linked to image nº25 A 60-year-old patient with a personal history of carcinoma of the lung presented with a two-week history of back pain and irradiated pain to the right arm and hand three days ago. MRI of the column shown in the image is performed. Given these clinical and radiological findings indicate the correct answer:
