Cuaderno_2015_1_M	26	question	-	Question linked to image nº27 A 50-year-old woman with systemic lupus erythematosus who complains of pain in her knees. In the anteroposterior radiography of knees signs compatible with all the diseases that are listed below except one are appreciated. Indicate it:
