Cuaderno_2015_1_M	42	question	-	Amalia is a 3 year old girl who has been operated on tetralogy of Fallot. He also presented a thymic dysfunction in the neonatal period and a hypocalcemia as well as a nasal voice together with psychomotor retardation. What genetic test do you consider most appropriate to reach your etiological diagnosis?
