Cuaderno_2015_1_M	74	question	-	A patient with Salmonella gastroenteritis, comes to the consultation. The patient is dehydrated. What treatment would you give, knowing that, previously, the patient did not have any disease?
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	74	answer	0	Intravenous amoxicillin.
