Cuaderno_2015_1_M	83	answer	2	External radiotherapy or radiosurgery.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	83	answer	3	Treatment of hypogonadotropic hypogonadism with testosterone.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	84	question	-	In a hospitalized patient who is unable to feed orally for more than 6 days, in which of the following clinical situations do we necessarily use parenteral nutrition?
