Cuaderno_2015_1_M	85	question	-	In a routine analysis of a 59-year-old woman, smoker of 20 cigarettes / day for 25 years, a hypercalcemia of 11.3 mg / dL was detected with a phosphorus of 3.4 mg / dL. It would NOT be efficient to enter:
