Cuaderno_2015_1_M	86	question	-	Indicate the metabolite of the adrenal steroidogenesis most useful in the diagnosis of delayed 21-hydroxylase deficiency:
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	86	answer	0	Pregnenolone.
