Cuaderno_2015_1_M	137	question	-	You value a 66-year-old patient with inguinal pain accentuated with prolonged standing several days a month. A simple x-ray of the hips shows narrowing of the femoro-acetabular joint space, sclerosis and osteophytes. What is your attitude?
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	137	answer	0	I make the diagnosis of coxarthrosis and send it to the traumatologist to place a hip prosthesis.
