Cuaderno_2015_1_M	156	question	-	A 64-year-old woman who came to the clinic referring to genital bleeding that had been going on for several months. Denies hormone replacement therapy and anticoagulation. It provides normal cervicovaginal cytology. General and genital physical examination without interesting findings. BMI of 38 Kg / m2. Indicate the most correct attitude:
