Cuaderno_2015_1_M	190	question	-	The use of the statistical technique of multiple regression allows:
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	190	answer	0	Determine the minimum values ​​of the dependent variable.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	190	answer	1	Establish which independent variables influence the dependent variable.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	190	answer	2	Determine the importance of the dependent variable in the population.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	190	answer	3	Establish the simultaneous relationship between a large number of predictor variables.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	191	question	-	In a pharmacoeconomic study that compared two antibiotic drugs in the treatment of pneumonia, the costs of medication, of the complementary and analytical tests, of hospitalization, of the adverse effects of the medication, of the transport to the hospital and of the loss were included. of patient productivity. What was the perspective of the study?
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	191	answer	0	Hospital perspective.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	191	answer	1	Perspective of the National Health System.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	191	answer	2	Out-of-hospital perspective.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	191	answer	3	Perspective of society.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	192	question	-	What is meant by the efficiency of a health service?
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	192	answer	0	The extent to which a health service improves the health status of the population at the lowest possible cost.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	192	answer	1	The possibility that a subject has to be treated by the health system regardless of their social status, sex or place of birth.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	192	answer	2	The improvement of the health status of the population obtained by a health service under usual or real conditions of action.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	192	answer	3	The extent to which a health service achieves its objectives of improving the health status of the population it serves.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	193	question	-	The claims of the patients or their relatives that are received in the User Care Units are an indicator of quality, but what quality component do they measure?
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	193	answer	0	The quality of the attention of the Customer Service Unit.
