Cuaderno_2015_1_M	193	answer	2	The quality of the treatment of patients in terms of adherence to the guidelines of Good Clinical Practice.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	193	answer	3	The intrinsic or scientific-technical quality.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	194	question	-	The most useful classification of vaccines is divided into live or attenuated vaccines and inactivated vaccines. Which of the following diseases can be prevented with a live attenuated vaccine?
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	194	answer	0	Rubella.
