Cuaderno_2015_1_M	194	answer	3	Hepatitis B.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	195	question	-	Regarding childhood vaccinations, which of the following statements is correct?
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	195	answer	0	Preterm infants should be vaccinated according to their corrected age.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	195	answer	1	Live attenuated vaccines are generally contraindicated in immunocompromised children.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	195	answer	2	The MMR vaccine (measles, rubella and mumps) is contraindicated in children with egg allergy.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	195	answer	3	Immunoglobulins interfere with inactivated (killed) vaccines.
