Cuaderno_2015_1_M	197	answer	2	Live attenuated vaccines are recommended.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	197	answer	3	When faced with a risk exposure, the pregnant woman may receive nonspecific immunoglobulins.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	198	question	-	Of the following preventable diseases with vaccines, which one has been eradicated in the whole world ?:
