Cuaderno_2015_1_M	201	question	-	We perform the determination of prostate-specific antigen (PSA) to diagnose prostate cancer in adolescents and healthy elderly, without benign prostatic hyperplasia:
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	201	answer	0	PSA sensitivity in adolescents will be higher than in the elderly.
