Cuaderno_2015_1_M	201	answer	2	The internal validity of PSA in healthy adolescents or elderly will not change.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	201	answer	3	The positive predictive value of PSA in adolescents will be higher than in the elderly.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	202	question	-	A 34-year-old patient who plays tennis receives the impact of the ball at the level of the left orbit. On examination, there is a significant palpebral hematoma, hyposphagma, diplopia to the superior vision with limited upper version of the eyeball. What would you suspect?
