Cuaderno_2015_1_M	202	answer	2	Fracture of the superior wall of the orbit with trapping of the superior rectus muscle.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	202	answer	3	Dentoalveolar fracture.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	203	question	-	Regarding the pleomorphic adenoma, point out the correct answer:
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	203	answer	0	It is a tumor of the salivary glands that rarely recurs.
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	203	answer	1	It affects predominantly the sublingual gland.
