Cuaderno_2015_1_M	204	question	-	Indicate which characteristic of the whiplash direction of the nystagmus is characteristic of an acute peripheral non-positional vestibular syndrome:
Cuaderno_2015_1_M	204	answer	0	With visual fixation and in the primary position of the gaze changes or alternates the direction spontaneously and periodically.
