Cuaderno_2015_1_M	210	question	-	A man with myopia magna, 47 years old, who underwent surgery for cataracts 2 years ago, goes to the emergency room referring to a profound and painless loss of vision in his right eye. Which of the following diagnoses can this symptom cause?
