Cuaderno_2015_1_P	31	answer	1	They apply from 8 years and a half.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	31	answer	2	They include a scale of psychomotricity.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	31	answer	3	They are applied collectively, so they are useful in the school environment.
