Cuaderno_2015_1_P	33	answer	0	Biological
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	33	answer	1	Psychopathological
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	33	answer	2	Internal and logical.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	33	answer	3	Sociocultural
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	34	question	-	The assessment instruments for screening (screening) of children's development aim to:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	34	answer	0	Provide a measure of global intelligence.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	34	answer	1	Evaluate specific skills.
