Cuaderno_2015_1_P	34	answer	3	Diagnose children with a remarkable intellectual development.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	35	question	-	According to the model proposed by J.P. Guilford, the evaluation of intelligence must be done:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	35	answer	0	Measuring general intelligence (or factor g).
