Cuaderno_2015_1_P	36	answer	1	Skills committed to creative ability.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	36	answer	2	Skills linked to the management of daily life.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	36	answer	3	Activities linked to the capacity for emotional adaptation.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	37	question	-	One of the most used tests in the neuropsychological evaluation of general cognitive deterioration is:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	37	answer	0	Mini-Mental State Examination (MMSE) da Folstein (1975).
