Cuaderno_2015_1_P	38	answer	2	The verbal and numerical ability.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	38	answer	3	The Depression.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	39	question	-	In recent decades and in relation to aptitude and / or achievement tests, the classical theory of tests is being replaced by:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	39	answer	0	The conglomerate theory.
