Cuaderno_2015_1_P	39	answer	3	The objective techniques.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	40	question	-	In a communicative interaction directed to the psychological evaluation we can say, as a general criterion, that the final computation of words of the evaluator must be:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	40	answer	0	Lower than the evaluated.
