Cuaderno_2015_1_P	126	answer	2	The day hospital.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	126	answer	3	The sheltered floors.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	127	question	-	According to the latest formulation of the theory of C.L. Hull, for a behavior to be carried out:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	127	answer	0	It is only necessary that a habit exists.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	127	answer	1	It only requires the existence of an impulse or need.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	127	answer	2	It requires a habit to exist and that both an impulse and an incentive be present.
