Cuaderno_2015_1_P	129	answer	2	The technique of the suffix.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	129	answer	3	The method of savings.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	130	question	-	The minimum increase in stimulation that allows detecting a change in sensation is known as:
