Cuaderno_2015_1_P	134	answer	2	When you should say "blue" before the word "blue" written in red ink.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	134	answer	3	When you should say "red" before the word "blue" written in red ink.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	135	question	-	What is the kind of memory that knowledge represents about how things are done ?:
