Cuaderno_2015_1_P	137	answer	3	Self-perception
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	138	question	-	When a subject makes judgments about the frequency of an event based on the examples that he remembers most immediately, he is developing a cognitive process called:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	138	answer	0	Representation bias
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	138	answer	1	Availability bias
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	138	answer	2	Illusory correlation.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	138	answer	3	Fundamental attribution error.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	139	question	-	What can be derived from empirical studies that analyze the relationship between the number of observations and the appearance of help behaviors ?:
