Cuaderno_2015_1_P	140	question	-	Which of the following factors REDUCES the appearance of compliance processes? :
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	140	answer	0	Need to offer a public response.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	140	answer	1	High difficulty of the judgments that must be issued.
