Cuaderno_2015_1_P	140	answer	3	Lack of unanimity within the group.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	141	question	-	If a patient states without being true, that he was in a hospital exactly the same as he is now (or that both places exist in parallel at different spatial points), or that he already knew the nurses, it is about:
