Cuaderno_2015_1_P	149	answer	3	Pollystoff syndrome.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	150	question	-	To the degenerative disorder of the brain that produces a gradual decline in intellectual function, with memory problems being one of the first symptoms, it is called:
