Cuaderno_2015_1_P	154	question	-	The hallucination extracampina is characterized because:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	154	answer	0	It is a hallucination that is experienced outside the visual field.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	154	answer	1	It is a morbid variety of synesthesia.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	154	answer	2	The correct perception of the stimulus is superimposed on the hallucination.
