Cuaderno_2015_1_P	155	question	-	Pareidolia is an experience about which we can affirm that:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	155	answer	0	The individual provides organization and meaning to an ambiguous or unstructured stimulus.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	155	answer	1	It is a rare anomaly, which sometimes appears in organic states and in schizophrenia.
