Cuaderno_2015_1_P	171	answer	2	Noradrenaline
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	171	answer	3	Somatostatin.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	172	question	-	Which of the following traumatic events has a greater chance of leading to a Post Traumatic Stress Disorder ?:
