Cuaderno_2015_1_P	172	answer	2	A sexual assault
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	172	answer	3	A railway accident with multiple victims.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	173	question	-	What is the primary symptom of Generalized Anxiety Disorder ?:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	173	answer	0	The hyperlability of the activation of the autonomic nervous system.
