Cuaderno_2015_1_P	176	answer	2	The theory of the incubation of Eysenck.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	176	answer	3	Theories of anxiety expectations (for example, the Reiss model).
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	177	question	-	What is the maximum period of time after the traumatic event in which a diagnosis of Acute Stress Disorder can be made ?:
