Cuaderno_2015_1_P	177	answer	2	One month.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	177	answer	3	Three months.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	178	question	-	In Mowrer's two-factor theory for explaining the acquisition and maintenance of Specific Phobias, what is the role of Operant Conditioning ?:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	178	answer	0	Play a fundamental role in the acquisition of fear.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	178	answer	1	Play a fundamental role in the maintenance of fear.
