Cuaderno_2015_1_P	181	answer	2	Generalized anxiety disorder.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	181	answer	3	Obsessive Compulsive Disorder
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	182	question	-	According to the reformulated model of learned helplessness, what are the attributions that a person with depression does for an uncontrollable negative event ?:
