Cuaderno_2015_1_P	182	answer	1	Internal, stable and global.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	182	answer	2	External, stable and global.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	182	answer	3	External, stable and specific.
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	183	question	-	What name does the co-occurrence of a mental or behavioral disorder with a substance use disorder receive at the same time ?:
