Cuaderno_2015_1_P	184	answer	3	Old age (from 70 years old).
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	185	question	-	Which of the following factors is more related to an increase in the probability of recurrence of a major depressive episode ?:
Cuaderno_2015_1_P	185	answer	0	Early start of the first episode (i.e. early age).
