Cuaderno_2015_1_Q	25	answer	3	The Clausius-Clapeyron equation provides the slope of the vapor pressure of a substance as a function of its molar volume when the liquid substance is in equilibrium with its vapor.
Cuaderno_2015_1_Q	26	question	-	In relation to molecular symmetry, select the correct statement:
Cuaderno_2015_1_Q	26	answer	0	The water molecule, formed by three atoms, belongs to the point group of symmetry C3V.
