Cuaderno_2016_1_E	76	answer	3	Diarrhea.
Cuaderno_2016_1_E	77	question	-	Which substance is indicated to antagonize the effect of unfractionated heparins in case of Hemorrhage ?:
Cuaderno_2016_1_E	77	answer	0	Protamine
Cuaderno_2016_1_E	77	answer	1	Vitamin K.
