Cuaderno_2016_1_E	169	question	-	In the management and administration of services there is a method that was proposed by Hanlon for the prioritization of problems. The formula proposed in this method is composed of four criteria, where one of them can by itself make the problem analyzed obtain a global value of 0, given how this criterion works within the formula and the range of value it can have. Point out what this criterion of Hanlon methods is:
