Cuaderno_2016_1_E	176	question	-	Andrea goes to the consultation for nutritional imbalance higher than the needs, objectivable with a BMI higher than 27. The nurse considers it opportune to change habits in food and activity. For the proposal of objectives with Andrea, estimates the Basal Energy Expenditure (GEB). What precise data to obtain about Andrea for the calculation of GEB according to the formula of Harris-Bennedict ?:
