Cuaderno_2016_1_E	187	question	-	LCS, a 34-year-old woman, goes from cooperation to a refugee camp for a year; is on treatment with methotrexate for 1 year due to the diagnosis of rheumatoid arthritis. On the occasion of a trip to Morocco, a dose of vaccine against hepatitis A was given 7 months ago, would it be correct to administer a second dose today ?:
