Cuaderno_2016_1_M	19	question	-	Question linked to the image nº20 Patient of 65 years, smoker, who reports having presented hematuria with clots. During the diagnostic process, a urethrocystoscopy was performed, visualizing this image in the bladder. What would be the most likely diagnosis?
