Cuaderno_2016_1_M	21	answer	2	Lung abscess
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	21	answer	3	Necrotizing pneumonia
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	22	question	-	Question linked to image nº23 A 58-year-old man with no clinical or surgical history of interest other than a smoker with a history of progressive dyspnea. Goes to the emergency room due to increased dyspnea. The chest X-ray taken is shown in the image. Indicate in which semiological group should be framed:
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	22	answer	0	Tumor of soft tissues of the chest wall.
