Cuaderno_2016_1_M	23	answer	3	Proof of challenge with exercise.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	24	question	-	Question linked to image nº25 A 45-year-old man, with no history of interest, went to the emergency room for dyspnea in the last 24 hours, since he returned from a trip from Mexico. In the emergency department, the image tests that are shown are performed. What is the most likely diagnosis?
