Cuaderno_2016_1_M	26	question	-	Question linked to image nº27 A 30-year-old man, carrier of the human immunodeficiency virus (HIV), who goes to the Emergency Department due to progressive loss of vision in his left eye, without other accompanying ophthalmological symptoms. At the funduscopic examination the image of the figure is observed. Before this image, it is possible to suspect:
