Cuaderno_2016_1_M	31	answer	1	Psoriasic arthritis.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	31	answer	2	Gouty arthritis
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	31	answer	3	Arthrosis
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	32	question	-	What would you suspect in a patient who has difficulty in laterally raising the arm (limitation of arm abduction from 30 degrees) and paresthesias in the lateral portion of the shoulder, without pain, and that the previous day has suffered a dislocation escapulohumeral?
