Cuaderno_2016_1_M	154	answer	2	Epilepsy of the mesial temporal lobe.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	154	answer	3	Consumption of drugs.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	155	question	-	Which of the following diseases does NOT present as an acineto-rigid syndrome?
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	155	answer	0	Huntington's disease
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	155	answer	1	Sydenham's disease
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	155	answer	2	Wilson's disease
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	155	answer	3	Progressive supranuclear palsy.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	156	question	-	In what situations would NOT surgery be indicated to treat a cerebral hemorrhage?
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	156	answer	0	Cerebellar hematoma> 3 cm in diameter and neurological deterioration.
