Cuaderno_2016_1_M	157	question	-	A 60-year-old man presents a picture of rapidly progressive dementia, rigidity, ataxia, myoclonus, which persists during sleep and high voltage discharges in the EEG. What alteration, among the following, is what we can find in the LCR?
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	157	answer	0	Hypoglucorraquia.
