Cuaderno_2016_1_M	157	answer	3	Protein 14-3-3 positive.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	158	question	-	On type I myotonic dystrophy (Steinert's disease), point out the INCORRECT statement:
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	158	answer	0	Muscle weakness in extremities is predominantly distal.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	158	answer	1	It is an autosomal recessive disease with almost complete penetrance.
