Cuaderno_2016_1_M	159	question	-	What is the name of the movement disorder characterized by simultaneous contraction of agonist and antagonist muscles, which induces postural changes and abnormal movements?
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	159	answer	0	Myoclonus
