Cuaderno_2016_1_M	159	answer	2	Korea.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	159	answer	3	Acatisia
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	160	question	-	A 43-year-old woman has been diagnosed by ultrasound with an intramural uterine myoma of 4 cm. Has two children. Her menstruations are of type 4-5 / 28-30, of a somewhat abundant amount, without clots and without pain. It does not have other symptoms. What would you recommend?
