Cuaderno_2016_1_M	160	answer	2	Hysterectomy conserving the ovaries.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	160	answer	3	Treatment with Gn-RH analogues for 6 months.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	161	question	-	A 31-year-old woman who comes to the clinic for 5 days of abundant rules for 2 years. His last rule was 8 days ago. In the initial assessment and when performing a vaginal ultrasound, a rounded, well-defined, homogenous and hypoechoic formation of 25 mm is evidenced in the endometrial cavity. What would be the pattern to follow?
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	161	answer	0	Perform endometrial aspirate.
