Cuaderno_2016_1_M	208	answer	1	Neoadjuvant chemotherapy and subsequently evaluate surgery.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	208	answer	2	Initial chemotherapy and then assess radiotherapy.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	208	answer	3	Surgery and evaluate adjuvant chemotherapy later.
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	209	question	-	What is the diagnostic technique of choice to locate the origin of the primary tumor and its extension in patients with carcinoid syndrome?
Cuaderno_2016_1_M	209	answer	0	Thoraco-abdomino-pelvic CT.
