Cuaderno_2016_1_P	54	question	-	The circumstantiality of thought is characterized because:
Cuaderno_2016_1_P	54	answer	0	It is often accompanied by motor passivity, affective indifference and / or lack of motivation to act.
Cuaderno_2016_1_P	54	answer	1	The connections between successive thoughts are established, in many cases, at random or in terms of the similarity of sounds between words, or by proverbs, etc.
