Cuaderno_2017_1_E	1	question	-	The law 41/2002, of November 14, regulating the autonomy of the patient and of rights and obligations in matters of information and clinical documentation, in its article 11, speaks of Previous Instructions, or Living Will or Advance Directives. What is the purpose of this document ?:
Cuaderno_2017_1_E	1	answer	0	Although it is mentioned in the Law, it has not been carried out in the Autonomous Communities because of the complexity of its execution.
Cuaderno_2017_1_E	1	answer	1	By this document, a person of legal age, capable and free, expresses his will in advance, so that it is fulfilled at the moment he reaches situations in which he is not able to express it personally, about care and treatment of his health or the fate of your body and organs if you die.
Cuaderno_2017_1_E	1	answer	2	By this document, a person of legal age, capable and free, expresses his will in advance, although the doctor who attends him, does not have to give him more importance than a complementary information.
Cuaderno_2017_1_E	1	answer	3	By this document, a person of legal age, capable and free, expresses in advance his will about the fate of his body and organs when he dies.
