Cuaderno_2017_1_E	45	answer	2	The tricuspid valve and the semilunar valves are closed and the mitral valve is open.
Cuaderno_2017_1_E	45	answer	3	The semilunar valves are open and the tricuspid and mitral valves are closed.
Cuaderno_2017_1_E	46	question	-	As established by the latest recommendations of the European Cardiovascular Society regarding the prevention of cardiovascular disease:
Cuaderno_2017_1_E	46	answer	0	All healthy adults of any age are recommended to practice a minimum of 150 minutes per week of moderate intensity aerobic activity or 75 minutes per week of intense aerobic physical activity or an equivalent combination.
