Cuaderno_2017_1_F	111	question	-	In the bicompatimental pharmacokinetic model, after intravenous administration in bolus, different volumes of distribution can be calculated: central compartment volume (V1), total volume in steady state (Vdss), extrapolated volume (Vdextr) and area volume (Vdarea). The calculation of Vdss is made from:
