Cuaderno_2017_1_F	216	question	-	Indicate the correct statement about the biological activity of immunoglobulins (Ig):
Cuaderno_2017_1_F	216	answer	0	IgG is the most abundant Ig in the intestinal lumen, where it performs its function as a neutralizing antibody.
Cuaderno_2017_1_F	216	answer	1	IgG activates the classical pathway of the Complement System through the interaction of its Fab region.
Cuaderno_2017_1_F	216	answer	2	Dimeric IgA is an opsonin that allows phagocytosis of pathogens via FcαR receptors.
