Cuaderno_2017_1_F	217	answer	2	It induces the proliferation of naive B lymphocytes in the lymph node after the expansion of activated B lymphocytes.
Cuaderno_2017_1_F	217	answer	3	It conditions the microenvironment of the germinative center to make the isotype change during the adaptive response.
Cuaderno_2017_1_F	218	question	-	Which of the following molecules participates in the extravasation of the T lymphocytes to the target tissue ?:
