Cuaderno_2017_1_P	46	answer	1	Difficulties of concentration due to concerns.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	46	answer	2	Prolonged pattern of sensitivity or interpersonal rejection.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	46	answer	3	Psychotic characteristics congruent with the state of mind.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	47	question	-	Which of the following is a characteristic of Dysthymia or Persistent Depressive Disorder ?:
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	47	answer	0	It may involve the appearance of hypomanic episodes.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	47	answer	1	In a state of subsyndromic depression after experiencing a Major Depressive Disorder.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	47	answer	2	Its symptoms last a minimum of one year.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	47	answer	3	Its symptoms last a minimum of two years.
