Cuaderno_2017_1_P	133	question	-	What would be the most appropriate way to carry out an exposure program for obsessive thoughts in a patient with an obsessive-compulsive disorder ?:
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	133	answer	0	Exposing the patient to the feared situations, starting with the least disturbing obsessive thought and following with the most disturbing ones.
