Cuaderno_2017_1_P	213	question	-	For the use of parametric statistical tests, it is necessary to analyze compliance with the assumptions of the statistical model. In this sense, point out the INCORRECT statement:
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	213	answer	0	To analyze the assumption of homogeneity of the variances, it is recommended to use the Levene test for being robust in case of non-compliance with the assumption of normality of the dependent variable.
