Cuaderno_2017_1_P	213	answer	2	To measure compliance with the normality of the dependent variable scores, it is recommended to use the Bartlett test.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	213	answer	3	In the presence of heterocedasticity, one of the methods that can be used is the correction of the degrees of freedom of the F test, which is called conservative F test.
Cuaderno_2017_1_P	214	question	-	Regarding the validity of statistical conclusion, when defining the power of a statistical test, indicate which of the following statements is INCORRECT):
